MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=0
RELEASE_VERSION=0
DEV_VERSION=1
GM=0
DESCRIPTION=Major release 4.0.0 after 3.3.0: treat the prior 3.3 line as superseded by this milestone semver. Repository policy no longer requires CodeRabbit or Codex CLIs, install attempts, triage gates, or a no-push rule tied to those tools; use normal GitHub review and optional integrations the maintainers enable. This row is still general availability metadata at the entries root (PRERELEASE absent or 0): DEV_VERSION tracks in-repo iteration before any move into version/entries/preproduction 4.0.0/. When the line is frozen for main, move under preproduction 4.0.0/ with PRERELEASE=1, keep bumping DEV_VERSION via ./scripts/bump_dev_version.sh, then set GM=1 on exactly one file and run ./scripts/promote_preproduction_for_main.sh to merge all preproduction .ver DESCRIPTION fields into one root GA file and delete the preproduction directory from both version/entries and version/locked.
